flowchart TB
  accTitle: Spectra setup: starting project, installation, discovery and configuration
  accDescr: Choose init for a new project or adopt for an existing codebase. Both install the Spectra layer; adopt additionally creates discovery evidence. Git mode changes tracking policy. Adapters are generated only when requested. Matching explanation groups S1 to S4 describe the paths and preservation rules.
  subgraph SETUP_START["S1 · Starting project"]
    direction LR
    NEW["New project"]
    EXISTING["Existing codebase"]
  end
  subgraph SETUP_INSTALL["S2 · Installation"]
    direction LR
    INIT["spectra init<br/>New project"]
    ADOPT["spectra adopt<br/>Existing codebase"]
    LAYER["Spectra layer<br/>Launcher, runtime, docs"]
    INIT -->|creates| LAYER
    ADOPT -->|creates| LAYER
  end
  NEW -->|choose| INIT
  EXISTING -->|choose| ADOPT
  subgraph SETUP_DISCOVERY["S3 · Existing-project discovery"]
    direction LR
    READ["Read layout<br/>Manifests and sources"]
    EVIDENCE["Repository evidence<br/>Index and discovery docs"]
    READ -->|records| EVIDENCE
  end
  ADOPT -.->|adopt only| READ
  subgraph SETUP_CHOICES["S4 · Configuration choices"]
    direction TB
    GIT["Git mode?<br/>Tracking policy"]
    LOCAL["local mode<br/>Git exclude only"]
    SHARED["shared mode<br/>Visible to Git"]
    AGENTS["--agents given?<br/>Optional"]
    ADAPTERS["Tool adapters<br/>Requested tools only"]
    GIT -->|default| LOCAL
    GIT -->|shared| SHARED
    AGENTS -.->|yes| ADAPTERS
  end
  LAYER -->|apply options| GIT
  SETUP_DISCOVERY ~~~ SETUP_CHOICES
  classDef command fill:#ffffff,stroke:#6c5ce7,color:#5143c6,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef result fill:#effcf8,stroke:#007f68,color:#121827,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef condition fill:#fff9ea,stroke:#8a5d00,color:#121827,stroke-width:1.5px;
  classDef neutral fill:#f2f8ff,stroke:#64748b,color:#121827;
  class INIT,ADOPT command;
  class LAYER,EVIDENCE,LOCAL,SHARED,ADAPTERS result;
  class GIT,AGENTS condition;
  class NEW,EXISTING,READ neutral;
